From: fay-dcp local build
Subject: [PATCH 0007] drm/apple: iomfb: DCP 14.7 tiling callbacks (PR #607, 62bd293c)

Backport of AsahiLinux/linux PR #607 commit 62bd293c: register the DCP 14.7
callbacks D115 get_tiling_state and D116 set_tiling_state (answered with
false). The previous commented-out entries used the 13.x numbers 114/115.
PR #608 (DCP 14.7 support for t8122) depends on this; it was missing from
the 7.2.2-fay-dcp build of 2026-10-03.

Apply with: patch -p1 (tree root of asahi-wip-7.2 + PR #608).

--- a/drivers/gpu/drm/apple/iomfb_v14_7.c
+++ b/drivers/gpu/drm/apple/iomfb_v14_7.c
@@ -58,8 +58,8 @@ static const iomfb_cb_handler cb_handler
 	[111] = trampoline_true, /* create_iomfb_service */
 	[112] = trampoline_create_backlight_service,
 	[113] = trampoline_true, /* create_nvram_service? */
-	//[114] = trampoline_get_tiling_state,
-	//[115] = trampoline_false, /* set_tiling_state */
+	[115] = trampoline_get_tiling_state,
+	[116] = trampoline_false, /* set_tiling_state */
 	[121] = dcpep_cb_boot_1, /* is_dark_boot */
 	[122] = trampoline_false, /* is_dark_boot / is_waking_from_hibernate*/
 	[123] = trampoline_false,
